  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0\n\nUpdates\nUpdated country data for Kazakhstan, Ethiopia, Norway, and Equatorial Guinea to reflect the latest \nchanges.\nCorrected Kazakhstan's capital, native name, and region codes, and added three missing regions.\nAdded the South West Ethiopia Peoples' Region.\nCorrected Norway's county codes to match ISO 3166-2.\nUpdated Equatorial Guinea's capital to Ciudad de la Paz.\nBreaking Changes\nKazakhstan's region codes have changed to the current ISO 3166-2 codes. Applications relying on the previous codes must be updated.\n\nBug Fixes\nFixed outdated country and region information.\nCorrected Kazakhstan's native name encoding.\nUpdated unit tests to reflect the changes.\nDeprecations\nN/A",
